<title>USA: Ambanc completes merger between affiliates.</title>
<headline>Ambanc completes merger between affiliates.</headline>
<dateline>VINCENNES, Ind. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambanc Corp, a bank holding company, said Monday it completed a merger between two affiliate banking companies.</p>
<p>Effective March 1, AmBank Illinois of Casey, Ill., was merged into AmBank Illinois N.A. of Robinson, Ill.  The merger will consolidate the Illinois banking operations into a single national charter.</p>
<p>AmBank Illinois N.A. has assets of about $286 million and operates 10 branches.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
